Alembic migrations for Task Hub.

The database URL is read from DATABASE_URL via app.core.config, not from
alembic.ini. To migrate a different target, change the env var:

    DATABASE_URL=postgresql+psycopg://taskhub:taskhub@localhost:5432/taskhub alembic upgrade head
    DATABASE_URL=oracle+oracledb://user:pass@host:1521/?service_name=XEPDB1 alembic upgrade head

Migrations MUST be verified against Oracle (XE in Docker is fine) before a
release is considered prod-ready. SQLite-only testing hides Oracle DDL issues.
